e right outside of the house.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tWrathful Archivist attacks in melee range. Wrathful Archivist never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tWrathful Archivist is immortal upon entry. After about 15 seconds blue books will appear in the room. Click one of them and a random mechanic will start.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Runes: Deactivate the runes by clicking them in order: east, west, and north</li>\n<li>Ghosts: Lure 3 ghosts over purple teleporters</li>\n<li>Animals: Feed all the animals by throwing their favourite food on the floor and making them walk over it; cheese for rats, bread (baguette) for rabbits, and meat to rotworms. In case you don't have food with you, walk all the way west in the room and use a machine there.</li></ul>\n<p>Upon completing the given mechanic you will be able to hit the boss for about 15 seconds. After that, if the boss is still alive, blue books will appear again and you need to repeat the process with another random mechanic.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 344 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 50 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Platinum Coin\" class